msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr "Edite a estrutura do menú como JSON. Cada elemento pode ter: name, icon, command (executado mediante a shell) ou action (unha acción de sesión: lock, logout, leave, switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (matriz de elementos) ou separator (true)."

